{"workId":"eusebius-church-history","editionId":"npnf2-mcgiffert-church-history","language":"english","ref":"p6.p26","title":"Bishops of Antioch","segments":[{"ref":"p6.p26.1","text":"Antioch."},{"ref":"p6.p26.2","text":"(Dates taken from the table given by Harnack in his Zeit des Ignatius, p. 62.)"},{"ref":"p6.p26.3","text":"Evodius."},{"ref":"p6.p26.4","text":"Zebinus, died between 238 and 249."},{"ref":"p6.p26.5","text":"Ignatius."},{"ref":"p6.p26.6","text":"Babylas, died in 250, during the persecution of Decius."},{"ref":"p6.p26.7","text":"Hero."},{"ref":"p6.p26.8","text":"Fabius, died toward the end of 252 or early in 253."},{"ref":"p6.p26.9","text":"Cornelius."},{"ref":"p6.p26.10","text":"Demetrian, died between 257 and 260."},{"ref":"p6.p26.11","text":"Eros."},{"ref":"p6.p26.12","text":"Paul, deposed between 266 and 269 (probably in 268)."},{"ref":"p6.p26.13","text":"Theophilus, died not earlier than 182."},{"ref":"p6.p26.14","text":"Domnus."},{"ref":"p6.p26.15","text":"Maximinus, died between 189 and 192."},{"ref":"p6.p26.16","text":"Timæus, died about 280."},{"ref":"p6.p26.17","text":"Serapion, died about 209."},{"ref":"p6.p26.18","text":"Cyril, sent to the mines in 303, and died probably toward the end of 306."},{"ref":"p6.p26.19","text":"Asclepiades, died between 211 and 222."},{"ref":"p6.p26.20","text":"Tyrannus, succeeded Cyril probably in 303, possibly not until 306, and lived until the close of the persecution."},{"ref":"p6.p26.21","text":"Philetus, died not long before 229–231."}]}
